        "TileImage": "$($repository f5837297-08e4-473d-8a4d-c348c58e1b3d).Image",
        "Description": "After a fail examination,you become a janitor. The rage controlls your body.\rEliminate your examiners and your bosses\r(P.S. I killed Athena by poison,but for unknown reason,it says &quot;any method&quot; so please use poison to kill her if you wish. There are two lethal poison in the building,in the second floor toilet box and underground safe deposit box.The poison on the second floor requires janitor&apos;s key which you can find it in the opposite room,if you can&apos;t find them,you can use hitmaps.com)\r:)",
